    "body": "The default behavior is for the Python module to only appear when you're in a Python project, determined by the presence of python-related files (e.g. `*.py` and `Pipfile`), as detailed here: https://starship.rs/config/#python\r\n\r\nUnless you have python files in your home directory, the behavior in your screenshot appears as expected.",
